# No Breaking Changes
Yes really.

# Highlights
* fixed: improve memory usage especially for "called" features #1685 
* fixed: some nagging issues with concurrent threads and `karate.callSingle()` and `callonce` #1558 
* the `@ignore` tag is now "baked-in", and there are some new ones, refer to the [docs](https://github.com/intuit/karate#special-tags)
* and you can "bind" tags to the value of `karate.env` in a very interesting and useful way, refer to the [docs](https://github.com/intuit/karate#environment-tags)
* if you use the [karate-gatling]() integration, please scan through the improvements in #1622 

